      "definition": "A Uyghur military commander who, having lost out in the palace killing-cycle of the 830s, defected to the Yenisei Kyrgyz and guided their army south onto the Uyghur heartland. His betrayal was the proximate trigger of the 840 sack of Ordu-Baliq — a reminder that steppe empires as often died from within as from without."
